<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1300s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 14th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1300s, 1,061 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 284 were founded and 181 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Ottoman Empire, the Golden Horde and the Kingdom of France.</p></header>
